From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 09:38:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mac80211: remove the stations of an AP VLAN before its
 links

ieee80211_do_stop() clears the links of an AP VLAN through
ieee80211_apvlan_link_clear() before it flushes the stations of the
VLAN. ieee80211_vif_update_links() then finds the station of a VLAN
that goes down while a station of an AP MLD is on it, and warns:

  WARNING: net/mac80211/link.c:352 at ieee80211_vif_update_links+0xcec/0xd30
  Call Trace:
   ieee80211_vif_set_links+0x3d/0x80
   ieee80211_do_stop+0x768/0xa80
   ieee80211_stop+0x7e/0x130
   __dev_close_many+0xdb/0x1a0

Reachable by setting a WDS VLAN down, or by removing the radio, while
its station is associated. Before commit ae6691b8c1fd ("wifi: mac80211:
check stations are removed before MLD change") the VLAN lost its
debugfs directory, station directories included, before the stations
were removed.

Clear the links of an AP VLAN only after its stations are removed.

Fixes: 90233b0ad215 ("wifi: mac80211: Create separate links for VLAN interfaces")
Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>

--- a/net/mac80211/iface.c
+++ b/net/mac80211/iface.c
@@ -511,9 +511,6 @@ static void ieee80211_do_stop(struct iee
 	case NL80211_IFTYPE_MONITOR:
 		list_del_rcu(&sdata->u.mntr.list);
 		break;
-	case NL80211_IFTYPE_AP_VLAN:
-		ieee80211_apvlan_link_clear(sdata);
-		break;
 	default:
 		break;
 	}
@@ -537,6 +534,9 @@ static void ieee80211_do_stop(struct iee
 		     sdata->vif.type != NL80211_IFTYPE_NAN &&
 		     sdata->vif.type != NL80211_IFTYPE_NAN_DATA && flushed > 0);
 
+	if (sdata->vif.type == NL80211_IFTYPE_AP_VLAN)
+		ieee80211_apvlan_link_clear(sdata);
+
 	/* don't count this interface for allmulti while it is down */
 	if (sdata->flags & IEEE80211_SDATA_ALLMULTI)
 		atomic_dec(&local->iff_allmultis);
